<title>CANADA: Sears Canada Inc Q4 shr net rises.</title>
<headline>Sears Canada Inc Q4 shr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.65		   C$0.29</p>
<p> Net			 63,000		   27,600</p>
<p> Revs		   1,310,000		1,300,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.09		   C$0.13</p>
<p> Net			  8,800		   12,200</p>
<p> Revs		   3,960,000		3,920,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: 1996 results included unusual items totalling C$45.0 million related to expenses for ongoing restructuring and cost-reduction initiatives. Sears Canada is 61-percent owned by Chicago-based Sears, Roebuck &amp; Co.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
